chool <span class="text-danger">*</span></th><td><input class="form-control" name="schoolName" value="<?= $esc($field('schoolName', $schoolId)); ?>" required></td></tr><tr><th>School ID</th><td><input class="form-control" value="<?= $esc($schoolId); ?>" readonly></td></tr><tr><th>SHS Curriculum</th><td><input class="form-control" name="shs_tracks_offered" value="<?= $esc($curriculum); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Complete School Address</th><td><textarea class="form-control" name="pbei_complete_school_address"><?= $esc($field('pbei_complete_school_address', $profileAddress)); ?></textarea></td></tr><tr><th>Schools Division</th><td><input class="form-control" name="division" value="<?= $esc($field('division', $field('district'))); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Region</th><td><input class="form-control" name="region" value="<?= $esc($field('region')); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Name of the School Administrator</th><td><input class="form-control" name="schoolAdministrator" value="<?= $esc($field('schoolAdministrator', $administrator)); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Contact No.</th><td><input class="form-control" name="schoolAdministratorContactNo" value="<?= $esc($field('schoolAdministratorContactNo', $contact)); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Official School Email Address</th><td><input class="form-control" type="email" name="schoolEmail" value="<?= $esc($field('schoolEmail')); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>School Year Effectivity of the Recognition Applied For</th><td><input class="form-control" name="school_year_effectivity" value="<?= $esc($field('school_year_effectivity', date('Y') . '–' . (date('Y') + 1))); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Date of Ocular Inspection</th><td><input class="form-control" type="date" name="ocular_inspection_date" value="<?= $esc($field('ocular_inspection_date')); ?>"></td></tr><tr><th>Submission Date to the SDO</th><td><input class="form-control" value="<?= $esc($firstSubmitted !== '' ? date('F j, Y', strtotime($firstSubmitted)) : 'Not recorded'); ?>" readonly><small class="form-text text-muted">This date is based on the first submitted Part II requirement.</small></td></tr><tr><th>Submission Date of SDO to the RO</th><td><input class="form-control" type="date" name="sdo_to_ro_submission_date" value="<?= $esc($field('sdo_to_ro_submission_date')); ?>"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="card-footer bg-white border-0 text-right pb-4 px-3 px-md-4"><a class="btn btn-light" href="<?= base_url(); ?>Page/pbei_school_submissions">Cancel</a><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="mdi mdi-content-save-outline"></i> Save School Profile</button></div></form></section></div></div></main></div><?php include('includes/footer.php'); ?></div></div><div class="modal fade helper-modal" id="partOneHelperModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="partOneHelperTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered" role="document"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title" id="partOneHelperTitle"><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline"></i> Evaluation Tool Guide</h5><button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button></div><div class="modal-body px-md-4 py-4"><p class="helper-copy">This tool is to be completed collaboratively by the members of the Monitoring, Evaluation, and Inspection Team (MEIT). The MEIT is responsible for validating the compliance of private basic education institutions offering the SHS Program with the prescribed standards and requirements.</p><p class="helper-copy">This tool was developed based on the Certification Assessment Instrument created by the Private Education Assistance Committee (PEAC). The primary objective is to ascertain that private basic education institutions offering the SHS Program applying for Government Recognition of the Senior High School Program are meeting the requirements and standards prescribed by existing laws, regulations, and DepEd policies, concerning their operations as supported by evidence.</p><p class="helper-copy mb-0">Thus, the issuance of Government Recognition relies heavily on the evaluation results generated from using this tool. Input for continuous improvement and sustainability in systems, processes, competencies, facilities, and overall operations of private basic education institutions offering SHS Program is also captured by this tool, providing a solid basis for possible Technical Assistance and other developmental initiatives, as needed. Applicable provisions of Republic Act No. 10173, “Data Privacy Act of 2012,” shall be adhered to accordingly.</p></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-dismiss="modal">Got it</button></div></div></div></div><script src="<?= base_url(); ?>assets/js/vendor.min.js"></script><script src="<?= base_url(); ?>assets/js/app.min.js"></script></body></html>
